      "overlays": [
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#1",
          "text": "THE DEATH OF THE SUMMER OF LOVE 1969",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#2",
          "text": "10050 CIELO DRIVE: UNPRECEDENTED HORROR",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "text": "COLLECTIVE PARANOIA GRIPPING LOS ANGELES",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "text": "VALUABLES AND JEWELRY LEFT INTACT",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "text": "BIZARRE SIGNATURE: “PIG” & “HEALTER SKELTER”",
          "dur_s": 2.5
        },
        {
          "after_id": "TK1.01#9",
          "text": "COLD EXECUTION OF A FANATICAL COMMAND",
          "dur_s": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_withered_flower_on_asphalt",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "That innocent romantic dream shattered into a hundred pieces on one fateful summer night.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò",
          "words_spoken": 14
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_cielo_drive_estate_night",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "On the night of August 8 leading into the morning of August 9, 1969, an unimaginable darkness descended upon the luxurious estate at 10050 Cielo Drive.",
          "est_dur_s": 9.2,
          "src_script": "1.04#2",
          "words_spoken": 26
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_cielo_drive_living_room_somber",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Among the victims was the beautiful actress Sharon Tate, the director's wife who was nearly nine months pregnant.",
          "est_dur_s": 6.4,
          "src_script": "1.04#6",
          "words_spoken": 18
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#4",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_retro_radio_broadcast_table",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "On that morning, as the radio continuously broadcast reports of the massacre at Sharon Tate's home, the entire city of Los Angeles fell paralyzed with fear.",
          "est_dur_s": 9.0,
          "src_script": "1.07#1",
          "words_spoken": 26
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#5",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_intact_valuables_diorama",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The most terrifying realization was that the intruders had not acted for monetary gain or valuable jewelry.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.9,
          "src_script": "1.07#4",
          "words_spoken": 17
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#6",
          "role": "N1",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_withered_flower_on_asphalt",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Our Summer of Love died right on that very night.",
          "est_dur_s": 3.5,
          "src_script": "1.07#7",
          "words_spoken": 10
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_bloody_letters_forensic_wall",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Yet on the walls and front doors, the perpetrators had scrawled unsettling words: “PIG”, “RISE”, and a misspelled phrase: “HEALTER SKELTER”.",
          "est_dur_s": 7.5,
          "src_script": "1.09#3",
          "words_spoken": 21
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_invisible_puppet_master_shadow",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "They appeared to be executing a sinister theatrical script orchestrated from the shadows.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.4,
          "src_script": "1.10#6",
          "words_spoken": 13
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#9",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t9_manson_shadow_campfire_desert",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "It was the calculated execution of a fanatical command.",
          "est_dur_s": 3.7,
          "src_script": "1.10#8",
          "words_spoken": 9
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK1.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "t9_amber_eyes_closing_dossier",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode nine of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary at the link in bio.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "CTA — kêu gọi xem tập đầy đủ",
          "words_spoken": 14
        }
      ]
    },
