      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_confiscated_clocks_broken_mirror",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "Breaking into strangers' homes at midnight, taking nothing, only moving furniture.",
          "est_dur_s": 3.9,
          "src_script": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò",
          "words_spoken": 11
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_manson_shadow_campfire_desert",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "He was a thirty-four-year-old man of slight physical stature, yet possessing a piercing, hypnotic gaze.",
          "est_dur_s": 6.2,
          "src_script": "2.04#3",
          "words_spoken": 15
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_spahn_ranch_dilapidated_porch",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "He was a seasoned transient criminal who had spent more than half his life confined within juvenile reformatories and federal penitentiaries.",
          "est_dur_s": 8.7,
          "src_script": "2.04#5",
          "words_spoken": 21
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_haight_ashbury_psychedelic_street",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "Observing a counterculture captivated by free love and naive idealism, Manson exploited the “Halo Effect” of a wandering spiritual guru to cloak his predatory instincts.",
          "est_dur_s": 8.9,
          "src_script": "2.05#2",
          "words_spoken": 25
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_apocalyptic_desert_hideout",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "There, he began poisoning their minds with a demented apocalyptic dogma christened “Helter Skelter”.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "2.05#5",
          "words_spoken": 14
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_midnight_convoy_old_ford",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Stage Three: The Nocturnal “Creepy Crawling” Drills.",
          "est_dur_s": 2.9,
          "src_script": "2.06#6",
          "words_spoken": 7
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_confiscated_clocks_broken_mirror",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Manson led disciples on midnight burglaries into suburban homes, taking nothing but rearranging furniture to rehearse their sense of omnipotence and invisible dominance.",
          "est_dur_s": 9.6,
          "src_script": "2.06#7",
          "words_spoken": 23
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_unfreezing_love_bombing_circle",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "With each violation of domestic privacy left unpunished, the threshold for deviance expanded another step in their impressionable minds.",
          "est_dur_s": 7.9,
          "src_script": "2.06#8",
          "words_spoken": 19
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t9_cielo_drive_road_sign_shadow",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "This trajectory exemplifies a fundamental behavioral reality: when boundary-testing goes unchecked, the appetite for dark fantasy demands ever more destructive realities.",
          "est_dur_s": 8.7,
          "src_script": "2.06#13",
          "words_spoken": 21
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "t9_amber_eyes_closing_dossier",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode nine of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary at the link in bio.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "CTA — kêu gọi xem tập đầy đủ",
          "words_spoken": 14
        }
      ]
    },
