      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_mastermind_conspiracy_law_book",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "His hands never touched a weapon, yet the mastermind received the death penalty.",
          "est_dur_s": 4.6,
          "src_script": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò",
          "words_spoken": 13
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_linda_kasabian_witness_dossier",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "That witness was Linda Kasabian, a twenty-year-old young mother.",
          "est_dur_s": 3.2,
          "src_script": "4.04#2",
          "words_spoken": 9
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#3",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_courtroom_gavel_bench",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Standing on the witness stand and looking into the eyes of Charles Manson, an icy dread ran down my spine.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.9,
          "src_script": "4.05#1",
          "words_spoken": 20
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#4",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_vacant_eyes_doll_shadow",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "The friends I had shared meals with at Spahn Ranch now sat there with empty, hollow eyes like wooden marionettes.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.9,
          "src_script": "4.05#2",
          "words_spoken": 20
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#5",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_cielo_drive_front_gate_fog",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "On that fateful night at Cielo Drive, as I stood frozen outside the gates listening to frantic cries in the dark, something profound inside me shattered.",
          "est_dur_s": 7.7,
          "src_script": "4.05#5",
          "words_spoken": 26
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#6",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_kasabian_escape_night_highway",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "The terror of losing my child and sheer revulsion toward slaughter woke me from that dark trance to flee into the desert night.",
          "est_dur_s": 6.8,
          "src_script": "4.05#7",
          "words_spoken": 23
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#7",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_mastermind_conspiracy_law_book",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "This was the doctrine of Conspiracy to Commit Murder and Vicarious Liability.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "4.08#6",
          "words_spoken": 12
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#8",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t9_prosecutor_desk_evidence_files",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "Though he never struck a blow, every violent act was the direct result of his absolute mandate.",
          "est_dur_s": 7.1,
          "src_script": "4.08#8",
          "words_spoken": 17
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_corcoran_state_prison_watchtower",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "In stark contrast, Charles Manson never once experienced genuine remorse; his Malignant Narcissism trapped him in Pathological Self-Pity, playing the perpetual victim of society until his death.",
          "est_dur_s": 10.9,
          "src_script": "4.09#9",
          "words_spoken": 27
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK4.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.0,
          "bg": "t9_amber_eyes_closing_dossier",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "Episode nine of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary at the link in bio.",
          "est_dur_s": 5.0,
          "src_script": "CTA — kêu gọi xem tập đầy đủ",
          "words_spoken": 14
        }
